{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Introduce use of drug-detection dogs to the House of Commons",
        "additional_details": "We think this could help:\r\n \r\nMaintain integrity: Parliament must uphold the laws it creates.\r\n \r\nEnsure safety: A drug-free workplace ensures a safe environment for all staff, visitors, and officials concerned with decision-making in public office.\r\n \r\nPublic confidence: Implementing visible deterrents restores and maintains public trust in democratic institutions.",
        "background": "We call on the House of Commons to implement certified drug-detection dogs to detect and deter the presence of illegal substances and to be used to conduct regular, unannounced sweeps of the House of Commons estate.",
